{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And Judah was comforted.</b> Its meaning: after he received consolations." "'on the shearers of his flock' — on account of 'under [it].'"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {0 "Resolved the abbreviation פי' as 'its meaning,' standard in Ibn Ezra's commentary.", 1 "The text appears to cite the word על at the start of Gen 38:12 redundantly; translated hyper-literally. Ibn Ezra apparently addresses why על is repeated before גוזזי צאנו, connecting it to the phrase תחת אל later in the verse."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:23.484720513Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}